### List Events
GET http://localhost:5000/api/events?category=Tech

### Get Event by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/events/66d000000000000000000001

### Create Event
POST http://localhost:5000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Global AI & Cloud Summit 2026",
  "description": "Executive conference exploring modern distributed architectures and AI agents.",
  "category": "Artificial Intelligence",
  "eventType": "Conference",
  "startDate": "2026-10-15T09:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-10-17T18:00:00Z",
  "registrationEnd": "2026-10-14T23:59:59Z",
  "capacity": 500,
  "tags": ["AI", "Cloud", "DevOps"]
}
